{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714470/extras/8c26dcc132433168f0ef7138d4c863f8.poster.avif?t=1773160143\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714470/extras/8c26dcc132433168f0ef7138d4c863f8.webm?t=1773160143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Characters]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lyra</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Created as humanity\u2019s ultimate weapon, Laila is sent back in time to Earth. Her mission is to obtain the \u201ccode\u201d for humanity\u2019s survival from the protagonist and rewrite history, preventing the Octopusians from conquering Earth. But instead of acting like a weapon, she finds herself hopelessly addicted to video games\u2014and starts wishing she could just stay in this era with the protagonist forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CV: </i>\u4f50\u4eac\u67da\u97f3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714470/extras/80d51256025826f29350580c942599da.poster.avif?t=1773160143\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714470/extras/80d51256025826f29350580c942599da.webm?t=1773160143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moonveil</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Octopusians from Planet Octopus are an all-female species, forced to rely on other races to reproduce. Tsukisa is the very first Octopusian to set foot on Earth, beginning her invasion and breeding project. In the future, she conquers Earth using the protagonist\u2019s powerful genes\u2014but after his death, she repeatedly rewinds time, returning to the past just to meet him again.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>CV: </i>\u987b\u5929\u3061\u3088\u3053</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714470/extras/e4a29cc07bd790642b82742a7838ce16.poster.avif?t=1773160143\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714470/extras/e4a29cc07bd790642b82742a7838ce16.webm?t=1773160143\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714470/extras/e4a29cc07bd790642b82742a7838ce16.mp4?t=1773160143\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>[Story]</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the future, Earth has fallen to the Octopusians. A small group of humans, desperate to resist, unlocks the full potential of AI consciousness. Laila, originally created as an intelligent robot, is sent back in time with one goal: to use the protagonist\u2019s genetic power to secure the future of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But as she lives together with him, things change. Laila becomes absorbed in video games\u2014like a virus creeping into her system, eating away at her sense of duty. She grows lazy, sharp-tongued, and even starts hoping the world will just end\u2026 so she can ignore her orders and stay in the past forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3714470/extras/7f4fbad852e4d5fc8ef0738a09d4e192.poster.avif?t=1773160143\" width=1138 height=640 ><source src=\"ht